                                                                                
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
*                                                                      *        
*  PROGRAM    :  W4285000                                              *        
*                                                                      *        
*  FUNCTION   :  PROGRAM TO READ WDA2 FILE AND CREATE TWO OUTPUT FILES *        
*                WHICH WILL BE USED IN THE W4285100 PROGRAM TO GENERAT *        
*                THE 'DEALER RETURN WEEKLY FOLLOW UP' REPORT           *        
*                                                                      *        
*     DATE        NAME                     INSTALLATION E'TRACKER      *        
*     111108      SHILPA MADHURI           E-TRACKER 10143271          *        
*                                                                      *        
*     120410      SUSANNE OLSSON           E-TR. 10143271  RÄTTA FEL   *        
*     121101      SUSANNE OLSSON           E-TR. 10181786  WEB AU(7838)*        
*                                                          FOLLOW-UP   *        
*                                                                      *        
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
                                                                                
FILE W42850D1                                                                   
W42850-IDPTYP 1 3    A                                                          
WDA201-DATA   4 145  A                                                          
WDA211-DATA   4 288  A                                                          
WDA221-DATA   4 1051 A                                                          
*                                                                               
*                                                                               
FILE W42850D2 FB (115 0)                                                        
%W42850   'W42850-'                                                             
*                                                                               
FILE W42850D3 FB (37 0)                                                         
%W42851   'W42851-'                                                             
*                                                                               
************************************************                                
*    WORKING STORAGE DECLARATIONS              *                                
************************************************                                
*                                                                               
%WDA201                                                                         
*                                                                               
%WDA211                                                                         
*                                                                               
*  CHECK IDDC VALUES                                                            
%WWDC99                                                                         
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*    --- TO CHECK IF "WEB DC"                                                   
%WL10WBDC                                                                       
*                                                                               
                                                                                
*                                                                               
%WDATAREA                                                                       
*                                                                               
%W418OKOD  'OKOD-'                                                              
*                                                                               
*WWDC02                                                                         
*                                                                               
%WORKAREA                                                                       
*                                                                               
*---------------- LÄNKAREA FÖR DATUMKORT                                        
%WDATKORT     'DAT-'                                                            
*                                                                               
WDATKONV        W  8   A   VALUE 'WDATKONV'                                     
WORKDAY         W  8   A   VALUE 'WORKDAY '                                     
W418OKOD        W  8   A   VALUE 'W418OKOD'                                     
PROGRAM-NAMN    W  6   A   VALUE 'W42850'                                       
DATUMKORT-ID    W  6   A   VALUE 'WDATUM'                                       
*                                                                               
JA              W  1   A   VALUE 'J'                                            
NEJ             W  1   A   VALUE 'N'                                            
YES             W  1   A   VALUE 'Y'                                            
FORSTA-GANG     W  1   A   VALUE 'J'                                            
HELP-IDDC       W  2   A                                                        
WS-IDDC-RET     W  2   A                                                        
WS-IDDISTR      W  4   N   0                                                    
WS-IDKUNDNR     W  6   N   0                                                    
WS-IDRAPPNR     W  7   N   0                                                    
WS-TOT-KVDAGAR  W  4   N   0                                                    
W-TIAAVV-ALFA   W  4   A                                                        
W-TIAAVV-NUM W-TIAAVV-ALFA  4   N                                               
WEEK-TIAAVV-ALFA   W  4   A                                                     
WEEK-TIAAVV-NUM WEEK-TIAAVV-ALFA  4   N                                         
THIS-WEEK       W  4   N                                                        
WS-LEV-BINDATE  W  6   N                                                        
WS-DATEDIFF     W  6   N                                                        
*S-TICC         W  2   A                                                        
*S-TIYYMMDD     W  6   A                                                        
WS-DATUM        W  6   N                                                        
WS-AAR          WS-DATUM   2         N                                          
WS-MAANAD       WS-DATUM  +2  2      N                                          
WS-DAG          WS-DATUM  +4  2      N                                          
TEMP-IDDC       W  2   A        VALUE  '  '                                     
TEMP-IDFTG      W  2   N   0                                                    
TEMP-SURADER    W  9   N   0                                                    
TEMP-KDANMTYP   W  1   N   0                                                    
WS-SURADER      W  9   N   0                                                    
                                                                                
                                                                                
W-KONV-AAAAMMDD W  8   N                                                        
W-KONV-AAMMDD   W-KONV-AAAAMMDD +2  6  N                                        
*    -- CHECKED BY WY2000                                                       
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*                                                                               
* STEP 1A:READ FILE AND SELECT THE RECORDS WITH COMPANY CODE 57 AND 60          
*      1B:SELECT ONLY LDC AND CHINA DC RECORDS WITH DISCREPENCY REASON          
*         CODE VALUES OF RETURN PERMIT ONLY                                     
*      1C:CHECK IF RETURN DATE IS GREATER THAN ZERO                             
*------------------------------------------------------------                   
*                                                                               
JOB INPUT W42850D1 START A-INIT                                                 
*                                                                               
IF W42850-IDPTYP = '201'                                                        
   ANM-WDA201 = WDA201-DATA                                                     
ELSE                                                                            
  IF W42850-IDPTYP = '211'                                                      
     LEV-WDA211 = WDA211-DATA                                                   
     HELP-IDDC      = LEV-IDDC-RET                                              
     PERFORM S23-CHECK-HELP-IDDC                                                
     PERFORM X-CHECK-IF-WEB-REPORT                                              
     IF WBDC-FLWEBDC = 'J'                                                      
        OKOD-KDANMORS  = LEV-KDANMORS                                           
        CALL W418OKOD USING OKOD-W418OKOD                                       
        IF OKOD-FL-RETILL = JA OR OKOD-FL-INTERNUPPACKNING = JA                 
          DAT-KDDATFORM                            = 'AAMMDD'                   
          IF ANM-DARETANK > +0                                                  
           W42850-DARETANK                       = ANM-DARETANK                 
*STEP2: CHECK BINNING DATE FOR TODAYS DATE                                      
           IF LEV-TIINLINL > +0                                                 
             DAT-I-TIDATUM                          = LEV-TIINLINL              
             CALL WDATKONV USING (DAT-KDDATFORM     +                           
                                  DAT-I-TIDATUM     +                           
                                  DAT-O-TIDATUM     +                           
                                  DAT-KDSVAR)                                   
             IF DAT-KDSVAR = ' '                                                
               W42850-TISAAPP-INLINL-TISEKEL        = DAT-TISEKEL               
               W42850-TISAAVV-INLINL-TISEKEL        = DAT-TISEKEL               
               W42850-TISAAPP-INLINL-TIAAPP         = DAT-TIAAPP                
               W-TIAAVV-ALFA                        = DAT-TIAAVV-GRP            
               W42850-TISAAVV-INLINL-TIAAVV         = W-TIAAVV-NUM              
               WS-LEV-BINDATE                       = DAT-TIAAMMDD              
             ELSE                                                               
               DISPLAY 'FEL FRÅN DATKONV TIINLINL = ' LEV-TIINLINL              
               STOP EXECUTE                                                     
             END-IF                                                             
             IF W-TIAAVV-NUM        =  THIS-WEEK                                
                W42850-TIINLINL     = LEV-TIINLINL                              
                W42850-DARETANK     = ANM-DARETANK                              
                W42850-KDMFUP       = WBDC-KDMFUP                               
                W42850-IDDC-RET     = LEV-IDDC-RET                              
                W42850-IDDISTR      = ANM-IDDISTR                               
                W42850-IDKUNDNR     = ANM-IDKUNDNR                              
                W42850-IDRAPPNR     = ANM-IDRAPPNR                              
                W42850-KDANMORS     = LEV-KDANMORS                              
                W42850-KVRETINL     = LEV-KVRETINL                              
                W42850-KVAVV-KVANT  = LEV-KVAVV-KVANT                           
                W42850-KVRETINL-SKR = LEV-KVRETINL-SKR                          
                W42850-KVAVV-KVAL   = LEV-KVAVV-KVAL                            
                W42850-IDARTNR      = LEV-IDARTNR                               
                W42850-SUARTSTD     = 0                                         
                W42850-ADCITY       = '                    '                    
                IF LEV-TIINLINL > +0 AND +                                      
                 ANM-DARETANK > +0                                              
                 WORK-KDCALL         = 001                                      
                 WORK-IDDC           = LEV-IDDC-RET                             
                 W-KONV-AAAAMMDD     = ANM-DARETANK                             
                 WORK-TIAAMMDD-FOM   = W-KONV-AAMMDD                            
                 WORK-TIAAMMDD-TOM   = WS-LEV-BINDATE                           
                 CALL WORKDAY  USING (WORK-KDCALL     +                         
                                      WORK-DATE-AREA  +                         
                                      WORK-KDSVAR)                              
                 IF WORK-KDSVAR = ' '                                           
                   W42850-KVDAGAR-INL = WORK-KVWORKD                            
                   PUT W42850D2                                                 
                 END-IF                                                         
                END-IF                                                          
*---         ELSE                                                               
*---           DISPLAY 'DIFF IN DATE' W-TIAAVV-NUM THIS-WEEK                    
             END-IF                                                             
           END-IF                                                               
*STEP2: CALCULATE THE TIME TAKEN FROM RETURNING TO BINNING                      
                                                                                
                                                                                
*STEP3: CHECK FOR NOT BINNED LINES. IF THE LINES ARE NOT TREATED THEN           
*       THE BINNING DATE IS ZERO.                                               
              IF LEV-TIINLINL = 0                                               
                IF LEV-KDKREBEH      = 'Y' OR  +                                
                   LEV-KDKREBEH      = 'J' OR  +                                
                   LEV-KDKREBEH      = 'C'                                      
                     W42851-KDMFUP   = WBDC-KDMFUP                              
                     W42851-IDDC-RET = LEV-IDDC-RET                             
                     W42851-IDARTNR  = LEV-IDARTNR                              
                     W42851-KVLEVANM-BEKR = LEV-KVLEVANM-BEKR                   
                     W42851-SUARTSTD = 0                                        
                     W42851-SURADER  = 0                                        
                     PUT W42850D3                                               
                END-IF                                                          
              END-IF                                                            
*---      ELSE                                                                  
*---         DISPLAY 'DARETANK NT > 0' ANM-DARETANK                             
          END-IF                                                                
        END-IF                                                                  
     END-IF                                                                     
  END-IF                                                                        
END-IF                                                                          
                                                                                
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*--------------------------------------------------------*                      
* A-INIT  HÄMTAR DAGENS DATUM, INNEVARANDE VECKA VV      *                      
*--------------------------------------------------------*                      
*                                                                               
 A-INIT.  PROC                                                                  
*                                                                               
 CALL DATKORT USING (PROGRAM-NAMN DATUMKORT-ID DAT-DATUMKORT)                   
*                                                                               
 WS-AAR    = DAT-D-AAR                                                          
 WS-MAANAD = DAT-D-MAANAD                                                       
 WS-DAG    = DAT-D-DAG                                                          
 DISPLAY ' DAGENS DATUM : ' WS-DATUM                                            
*                                                                               
           DAT-KDDATFORM                      = 'AAMMDD'                        
      IF WS-DATUM     > +0                                                      
       DAT-I-TIDATUM                          = WS-DATUM                        
       CALL WDATKONV USING (DAT-KDDATFORM     +                                 
                           DAT-I-TIDATUM      +                                 
                           DAT-O-TIDATUM      +                                 
                           DAT-KDSVAR)                                          
       IF DAT-KDSVAR = ' '                                                      
         WEEK-TIAAVV-ALFA                     = DAT-TIAAVV-GRP                  
         THIS-WEEK                            = WEEK-TIAAVV-NUM                 
       ELSE                                                                     
         DISPLAY ' *************************** '                                
         DISPLAY ' FEL VID ANROP TILL WDATKONV '                                
         DISPLAY ' *************************** '                                
                                                                                
         STOP EXECUTE                                                           
       END-IF                                                                   
      ELSE                                                                      
         THIS-WEEK                            =  0000                           
      END-IF                                                                    
                                                                                
 DISPLAY ' INNEVARANDE VECKA ' THIS-WEEK                                        
 END-PROC                                                                       
                                                                                
                                                                                
*    --- S23-CHECK-HELP-IDDC (MACRO PROCEDUR)                                   
%WWDC02 'HELP-'                                                                 
*                                                                               
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
X-CHECK-IF-WEB-REPORT. PROC                                                     
   WBDC-IDDC = HELP-IDDC                                                        
   CALL WL10WBDC USING WBDC-AREA                                                
END-PROC                                                                        
                                                                                
*                                                                               
*STEP4 :SORT THE FILE ON COMPANY CODE, RETURN DC, DIST ID, CUST ID,             
*       DISC REPORT NO, DISC REPORT CODE                                        
                                                                                
SORT W42850D2 TO W42850D2 USING +                                               
        (W42850-KDMFUP, W42850-IDDC-RET, W42850-KDANMORS)                       
                                                                                
*STEP5 :SORT THE FILE ON COMPANY CODE ,RETURN DC AND DISC CODE                  
                                                                                
SORT W42850D3 TO W42850D3 USING +                                               
        (W42851-KDMFUP, W42851-IDDC-RET, W42851-IDARTNR)                        
                                                                                
